A surprisingly small set of firms generates a surprisingly large share of Shelf Check's anxiety.

## The repeat offender problem

Spring & Mulberry Inc., Moonlight Packing Corporation, Ghirardelli Chocolate Company keep surfacing because frequency compounds risk.

## What consumers should watch

